   "source": [
    "1: RUNNING THE CODE PROVIDED\n",
    "\n",
    "(a) The code generates 300 synthesized number samples and classifies them into 4 clusters with different colors.\n",
    "The code below did run well after the installation of the libraries I have listed in the requirements.txt file I have associated with this project"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b8acf3c3-761d-4a08-9c01-ac60cadb1a78",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from sklearn.datasets import make_blobs\n",
    "\n",
    "X, y = make_blobs(n_samples=300, centers=4, random_state=0, cluster_std=1.0)\n",
