   "source": [
    "**Conclusion on max_depth changes:** when the value of max_depth was 1, the model was underfitting missing important details. When the value was changed to 3, there was an improvement and when the max_depth was 5, the model did the most best classification work. When max_depth was set to 7, there was an overfitting as you van observe from above plot"
